              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Marianne"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for a gathering of my Allrecipeeps, and it was a big winner. I baked bone-in skin-on chicken breasts seasoned with Papa's Seasoning blend from this site and then shredded the meat (makes gloriously tasty moist chicken). I couldn't find the Marzetti brand of blue cheese dressing so used a different brand. Otherwise I followed the recipe. Be sure to warn people who can't handle spicy heat very well because it is spicy. But oh-so-delicious! Winner!",
