              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lynn Crowe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Fantastic! I roasted bone in, skin on chicken breasts and then used that tender meat for the dip. I followed everything else in this recipe. We all loved it and I will definitely make it again.",
            "datePublished": "2023-02-13T01:16:51.271Z"
