            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "rk94ft6hvp"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I kind of used this as a starter recipe which made it easy and took into account some of the reviews! It didn’t seem to have enough sauce for our taste so I basically tripled it! I used almost two full 16 oz bottles of buffalo sauce, 2 packets of Ranch dressing (daughter hates blue cheese), 1 package 8 oz softened cream cheese, about 1 1/2 cups of shredded cheese and 3 large chicken breasts shredded. I mixed it all leaving 1/2 cup shredded cheese for topping. Put it all in the dish and baked at 375 for 25 min and it was AMAZING!",
            "datePublished": "2022-01-31T01:26:12.229Z"
          },
