              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mrehere"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Fantastic yet simple recipe. Aside from the shredding of the chicken, this was as simple as dumping the ingredients into a bowl, then baking. If you are reading this, give this a try.\n\nONE WARNING: Warn your guests that this dip is hot. Spicy hot (and maybe temp hot, too). We had a guest load up their tortilla chips with the dip expecting cheesy and was taken back by the heat. It is a wonderful flavor, sure to please, but make sure your guests know what they are getting.\n\nWill make this again and again. Perfect dip for those who like buffalo chicken! Only comment on the recipe is \"3 chicken breasts\" is too vague for me. We have 1lb breasts and 3lbs of chicken would be a bit too much. Wished it was stated in cups or better yet ounces.",
            "datePublished": "2017-12-24T01:44:04.360Z"
          },
